            <h4 style="color: #002147; border-bottom: 2px solid #004080; padding-bottom: 5px; font-size:20px; font-weight:600;">ABOUT PROF Y N SINGH</h4>
            <p style="font-size:16px; font-family:Arial; line-height:30px; text-align:justify; line-height:30px;color:black;">
                Prof. Yogendra Narain Singh is presently working as Director, Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh. He is a Professor of the Department of Computer Science & Engineering at Institute of Engineering & Technology, Dr APJ Abdul Kalam Technical University Uttar Pradesh, Lucknow, India and served as Head of department there till Nov 2023. He graduated in computer science & engineering from Harcourt Butler Technical University (Formerly HBTI) Kanpur. He received M. Tech. degree in Computer Science & Engineering from Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur (IITK) and PhD degree from Indian Institute of Technology (IIT-BHU), Varanasi. He has authored two books. He has to his credit over sixty research articles published in International Journals/ Conferences of repute. Dr. Singh is interested in the areas of Pattern Recognition, Machine Learning, Social Media Analytics, Medical Image Computing and Biometrics. He is the pioneer in biometric research, in particular, he developed the state-of-the-art biometric recognition system that recognizes individuals using a novel biometric electrocardiogram (ECG). He is one of the researchers whose paper is selected as the best biometrics-related papers across the Elsevier journals in 2015. He has honored to 'Best Teachers Award' and 'Certificate of Appreciation' by Dr APJ Abdul Kalam Technical University Uttar Pradesh Lucknow in 2022.
            </p>


